  (University of Toronto)\, but please check this page closer to the date f
 or the final location and room number.&#x20\;\n\nTopic: A Data-Driven Appr
 oach to Toronto's Electoral Geography\n\nWith colleagues\, Zach Taylor bui
 lt for research purposes fine-grained maps of historical election results 
