 n the future.\n\nSpeaker: Zack Taylor (he/him)\n\nZack Taylor is a profess
 or of Political Science and Geography at the University of Western Ontario
  where he specializes in urban politics\, local governance\, and political
  geography.\n\nAgenda:\n\n7:00-7:20 Welcome and Introductions\n\n7:20-7:50
